Phase 3: Telegram Bot Integration

1. Set up Telegram Bot (you'll need to create one via BotFather)
2. Create webhook handler for incoming Telegram messages
3. Implement phone matching logic (user sends phone → match to DB)
4. Generate and send OTP code back to user

Phase 4: OTP Verification (Web)

1. Create verification page to enter code from Telegram
2. Create API endpoint to verify OTP
3. Link Telegram account to user on successful verification
4. Handle redirect back to original destination

Phase 5: Notification System Update

1. Create Telegram notification service
2. Update WritingSubmissionObserver - send via Telegram (fallback to email)
3. Update WritingFeedbackObserver - send via Telegram (fallback to email)
